a reason)"],["هَلْ هَذَا قَلَمٌ؟","Is this a pen? (yes or no)"]]},{"t":"mistake","wrong":"هَلْ أَيْنَ؟","why":"Ali puts two question words together: هَلْ أَيْنَ؟ Wrong! One question word is enough: either “Is it…?” (هَلْ) or “Where…?” (أَيْنَ).","why_ar":"عَلِيٌّ يَجْمَعُ أَدَاتَيْنِ: «هَلْ أَيْنَ؟». هَذَا خَطَأٌ! تَكْفِي أَدَاةٌ وَاحِدَةٌ: «هَلْ…؟» (نَعَمْ أَوْ لَا) أَوْ «أَيْنَ…؟» (مَكَانٌ)."}],"can":["I can say what each question word asks for (who, what, where, how, why, when, how many, yes/no).","I can read a short question and answer it in English."],"can_ar":["أَسْتَطِيعُ أَنْ أَقُولَ عَمَّ تَسْأَلُ كُلُّ أَدَاةٍ (مَنْ، مَا، أَيْنَ، كَيْفَ، لِمَاذَا، مَتَى، كَمْ، هَلْ).","أَسْتَطِيعُ أَنْ أَقْرَأَ سُؤَالًا قَصِيرًا وَأُجِيبَ عَنْهُ بِالْإِنْجِلِيزِيَّةِ."],"covers":"Lesson 8: question words  ·  includes Lessons 1–7  ·  Stage 1 checkpoint","covers_ar":"الدَّرْسُ الثَّامِنُ: أَدَوَاتُ الِاسْتِفْهَامِ  ·  وَفِيهِ الدُّرُوسُ ١–٧  ·  مُرَاجَعَةُ الْمَرْحَلَةِ الْأُولَى","words":[{"lesson":8,"ar":"مَنْ","en":"who","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"مَا","en":"what","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"مَاذَا","en":"what","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"أَيْنَ","en":"where","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en":"how","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"لِمَاذَا","en":"why","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"مَتَى","en":"when","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"كَمْ","en":"how many","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"هَلْ","en":"(yes/no question)","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"نَعَمْ","en":"yes","pos":"q"},{"lesson":8,"ar":"لَا","en":"no","pos":"q"}],"sections":[{"name":"A","kind":"match","role":"skill","en":"Match each question word with its meaning.","ins":"صِلْ كُلَّ كَلِمَةٍ بِمَعْنَاهَا.","review":false,"items":[{"mode":"match","pairs":[["مَنْ","who"],["مَا","what"],["أَيْنَ","where"],["كَيْفَ","how"],["لِمَاذَا","why"]],"id":"796c7998"},{"mode":"match","pairs":[["مَتَى","when"],["كَمْ","how many"],["هَلْ","a yes/no question"]],"id":"91ae9873"}]},{"name":"B","kind":"write","role":"enar","en":"Choose 